# Compiled output emitted next to a TypeScript source. Two stale copies of
# __tests__/utils/McpTestClient.ts (`.js` + `.js.map`) were committed this way
# and then drifted from their source. Vitest transpiles the `.ts` directly, so
# nothing ever needs the emitted sibling; `pnpm build` writes to dist/.
__tests__/**/*.js
__tests__/**/*.js.map
